Package: mxplorer
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: MRG0721 <271227737+MRG0721@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Description: terminal file manager with a UI independent core
 mxplorer is a small file manager for Linux. It ships a terminal front-end, an
 interactive shell plus a one-shot command mode, on top of a C++ core library
 that does the file system work and stays free of any UI toolkit.
 .
 The core offers directory listing, stat, copy, move, remove, mkdir, name based
 search, progress callbacks and cancellation, so a Qt6 front-end can be added
 later without touching the file system logic.
 .
 This package contains the mxplorer command and its manual page.
